<!--
  Deliberately empty.

  MSBuild walks up from a project directory until it finds a Directory.Build.props,
  and stops there. Without this file, the submodule under external/ would inherit
  the root Directory.Build.props of *this* repository — which pins TargetFramework
  to net8.0 and would quietly collapse EdiX12.Core's netstandard2.0;net8.0
  multi-targeting.

  The submodule is a separate repository and builds with its own settings.
-->
<Project />
